  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "9.0.0: lockstep republish against the core 9.0.0 (ADR-0023: the core public surface is now the documented contract; Tier-2 implementation types internalised). No functional change to this package. 8.0.0: lockstep republish against the core 8.0.0 major (ADR-0022); no functional change to this package. 7.0.0: initial release. MongoDB sink and MongoDB-backed scraper-config and cookie storage (ScraperEngineBuilder.WriteToMongoDb / WithMongoDbConfigStorage / WithMongoDbCookieStorage) extracted from the WebReaper core per ADR-0009 so the core stays dependency-light and Native-AOT-clean (core no longer references MongoDB.Driver). Requires WebReaper 9.0.0.",
